From 85565dbd1526a6ad141df7826bde9c4dddaa8c37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:41:14 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Show event created_at and updated_at

created_at and updated_at join Event::$columns. Event::save() fills
created_at on create and updated_at on every save, and Event::update()
touches updated_at, always with PHP time. The show page and the listing
display "Criado em" and "Atualizado em" as dd/mm/yyyy hh:mm.
